<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#10191a">
    <title>VLE Lab — Vapor–Liquid Equilibrium Simulator</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: dark;
            --bg: #10191a;
            --panel: #172324;
            --line: #304344;
            --text: #e9f1ed;
            --muted: #9aadaa;
            --mint: #8ce0bd;
            --gold: #f1b76f;
            --blue: #81bcd0
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 0%, #203738 0, transparent 42%), var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            font: 15px/1.55 Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none
        }

        .wrap {
            max-width: 1160px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 28px
        }

        .nav {
            height: 78px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(143, 180, 169, .15)
        }

        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -.02em
        }

        .brand-icon {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            border: 1px solid #4c7066;
            border-radius: 11px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            color: var(--mint);
            font-size: 19px;
            background: #1b302e
        }

        .nav-right {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 26px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 13px
        }

        .nav-right a:hover {
            color: var(--text)
        }

        .nav-cta {
            color: var(--mint) !important;
            border: 1px solid #477565;
            padding: 8px 13px;
            border-radius: 8px
        }

        .hero {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.03fr .97fr;
            gap: 40px;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 72px 0 67px
        }

        .eyebrow {
            color: var(--mint);
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: .16em
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(38px, 5.6vw, 64px);
            line-height: 1.02;
            letter-spacing: -.055em;
            margin: 16px 0 18px;
            max-width: 620px
        }

        .hero h1 em {
            font-style: normal;
            color: var(--mint)
        }

        .lead {
            color: #b3c1bc;
            font-size: 17px;
            max-width: 530px;
            margin: 0
        }

        .actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 29px;
            flex-wrap: wrap
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 12px 17px;
            border-radius: 9px;
            font-weight: 650;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: transform .15s, filter .15s
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            filter: brightness(1.08)
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--mint);
            color: #10201b
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            background: rgba(27, 43, 43, .65)
        }

        .arrow {
            font-size: 18px
        }

        .micro {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-top: 16px
        }

        .preview {
            position: relative;
            border: 1px solid #365151;
            border-radius: 17px;
            background: linear-gradient(150deg, #1b2b2c, #142021);
            padding: 19px;
            box-shadow: 0 22px 60px #07100f66
        }

        .preview-head {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 15px
        }

        .preview-title {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 650
        }

        .badge {
            font-size: 10px;
            color: var(--mint);
            border: 1px solid #396657;
            border-radius: 99px;
            padding: 4px 8px
        }

        .chart {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block
        }

        .chart-label {
            fill: #97aaa5;
            font: 10px system-ui
        }

        .chart-grid {
            stroke: #314545;
            stroke-width: 1
        }

        .bubble {
            position: absolute;
            right: -15px;
            bottom: 22px;
            background: #243333;
            border: 1px solid #47605b;
            border-radius: 11px;
            padding: 9px 12px;
            font-size: 11px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px #0005
        }

        .bubble b {
            color: var(--gold);
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums
        }

        .section {
            padding: 35px 0 74px
        }

        .section-head {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: end;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px
        }

        .section h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            letter-spacing: -.03em;
            margin: 6px 0 0
        }

        .section-head p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin: 0;
            max-width: 370px
        }

        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 14px
        }

        .card {
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 13px;
            padding: 19px;
            background: rgba(23, 35, 36, .82)
        }

        .card-icon {
            height: 36px;
            width: 36px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: #203533;
            color: var(--mint);
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 14px
        }

        .card:nth-child(2) .card-icon {
            color: var(--gold);
            background: #352c22
        }

        .card:nth-child(3) .card-icon {
            color: var(--blue);
            background: #203036
        }

        .card h3 {
            font-size: 15px;
            margin: 0 0 6px
        }

        .card p {
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin: 0
        }

        .bottom {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 0 0 48px;
            padding: 20px 22px;
            border: 1px solid #35514a;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: linear-gradient(100deg, #1b302d, #192627)
        }

        .bottom strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 15px
        }

        .bottom span {
            display: block;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-top: 3px
        }

        .footer {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(143, 180, 169, .15);
            padding: 19px 0 28px;
            color: #81938d;
            font-size: 11px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between
        }

        .footer b {
            color: #b7c7c0;
            font-weight: 600
        }

        @media(max-width:800px) {
            .hero {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 32px;
                padding: 52px 0
            }

            .preview {
                max-width: 600px
            }

            .cards {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr
            }

            .section-head {
                display: block
            }

            .section-head p {
                margin-top: 9px
            }

            .bottom {
                align-items: flex-start;
                flex-direction: column
            }

            .nav-right>a:not(.nav-cta) {
                display: none
            }
        }

        @media(max-width:480px) {
            .wrap {
                padding: 0 17px
            }

            .nav {
                height: 68px
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 42px 0
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 42px
            }

            .lead {
                font-size: 15px
            }

            .actions {
                align-items: stretch;
                flex-direction: column
            }

            .btn {
                justify-content: center
            }

            .bubble {
                right: 8px;
                bottom: 10px
            }

            .footer {
                gap: 10px;
                flex-direction: column
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body class="bg-amber-100">
    <header class="wrap nav">
        <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="VLE Lab home"><span class="brand-icon">◒</span><span>VLE Lab</span></a>
        <nav class="nav-right " aria-label="Main navigation">
            <a class="nav-cta" href="/description">Description<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a class="nav-cta" href="/simulation">Open simulator <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </nav>
    </header>
    <main class="wrap">
        <section class="hero">
            <div>
                <div class="eyebrow">Interactive chemical engineering lab</div>
                <h1>See mixtures <em>find balance.</em></h1>
                <p class="lead">Explore vapor–liquid equilibrium one experiment at a time. Change the mixture and
                    conditions, then see how the vapor and liquid compositions respond.</p>
                <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/simulation">Start an experiment <span
                            class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="btn btn-secondary"
                        href="#how-it-works">How it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
                <p class="micro">A visual learning tool for phase equilibrium and distillation concepts.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="preview" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a vapor-liquid equilibrium diagram">
                <div class="preview-head"><span class="preview-title">Binary mixture · T–x–y diagram</span><span
                        class="badge">EQUILIBRIUM VIEW</span></div>
                <svg class="chart" viewBox="0 0 500 300" aria-hidden="true">
                    <defs>
                        <linearGradient id="area" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1">
                            <stop offset="0" stop-color="#8ce0bd" stop-opacity=".16" />
                            <stop offset="1" stop-color="#8ce0bd" stop-opacity="0" />
                        </linearGradient>
                    </defs>
                    <g class="chart-grid">
                        <path d="M58 34H475M58 84H475M58 134H475M58 184H475M58 234H475" />
                        <path d="M58 34V234M162 34V234M266 34V234M370 34V234M475 34V234" />
                    </g>
                    <path d="M58 234 C113 224 154 199 205 163 C264 122 321 86 370 67 C411 51 446 42 475 39 L475 234Z"
                        fill="url(#area)" />
                    <path d="M58 234 C113 224 154 199 205 163 C264 122 321 86 370 67 C411 51 446 42 475 39" fill="none"
                        stroke="#8ce0bd" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
                    <path d="M58 234 C101 225 138 208 180 182 C232 150 285 119 337 92 C390 66 437 49 475 39" fill="none"
                        stroke="#f1b76f" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="6 5" />
                    <circle cx="266" cy="122" r="5" fill="#f1b76f" stroke="#172324" stroke-width="3" />
                    <path d="M266 122V234" stroke="#f1b76f" stroke-dasharray="3 4" opacity=".75" />
                    <g class="chart-label"><text x="28" y="39">T</text><text x="47" y="238">0</text><text x="47"
                            y="39">1</text><text x="55" y="257">0</text><text x="468" y="257">1</text><text x="207"
                            y="280">Liquid composition x₁ / vapor composition y₁</text><text x="276" y="116"
                            fill="#f1b76f">x₁, y₁</text><text x="403" y="54" fill="#8ce0bd">Bubble point</text><text
                            x="397" y="79" fill="#f1b76f">Dew point</text></g>
                    <path d="M58 234V34M58 234H475" fill="none" stroke="#77908a" stroke-width="1.2" />
                </svg>
                <div class="bubble">Selected composition <b>x₁ = 0.50</b></div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="section" id="explore">
            <div class="section-head">
                <div>
                    <div class="eyebrow">Your virtual lab bench</div>
                    <h2>Explore the equilibrium</h2>
                </div>
                <p>Build intuition by changing one condition at a time and observing the phase behavior.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="cards" id="how-it-works">
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">◉</div>
                    <h3>Choose a mixture</h3>
                    <p>Set the component proportions and explore how mixture composition affects the two phases.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌁</div>
                    <h3>Adjust conditions</h3>
                    <p>Change temperature or pressure and follow the equilibrium response in the diagram.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌖</div>
                    <h3>Read both phases</h3>
                    <p>Compare liquid and vapor compositions to connect equilibrium behavior with separation.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="bottom">
            <div><strong>Ready to run your first case?</strong><span>Open the simulator and start exploring phase
                    equilibrium.</span></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/simulation">Go to simulator <span
                    class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="wrap footer"><span><b>VLE Lab</b> · Vapor–liquid equilibrium simulator</span><span>Learn by changing
            the conditions.</span></footer>
</body>

</html>